{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2025-04-22T01:33:32.958409+00:00", "modified": "2025-04-22T01:33:33.106804+00:00", "id": 15258773, "conceptrecid": "7563599", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15258773", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7563599", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15258773", "metadata": {"title": "Geospatial and time series dataset for hydrologic analyses within South Asia (GHSA)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15258773", "publication_date": "2025-04-21", "description": "<p>Summary of changes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>v2504, GHSA\n<ul>\n<li>1,702 stations from 5 countries in South Asia (Bhutan, China, India, Nepal and Pakistan);</li>\n<li>districts and basin states from 7 countries in South Asia (Afghanistan, Bangladesh, Bhutan, China, India, Nepal and Pakistan)</li>\n<li>land use change, vegetation index (NDVI, NDVI-crop), precipitation, evaporation (E-total, E-crop and E-irrigation), streamflow, surface and root zone soil moisture, terrestrial water storage change, snow water equivalent and snow cover fraction; 1950-2023</li>\n<li>publication:</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>v2409\n<ul>\n<li>test version</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>v2301, GHI\n<ul>\n<li>645 stations,&nbsp;limited to Peninsular India</li>\n<li>precipitation, evaporation and streamflow; 1950-2020</li>\n<li>publication: Goteti (2023), Earth Syst. Sci. Data, https://doi.org/10.5194/essd-15-4389-2023</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Goteti, Gopi", "affiliation": "Independent Researcher", "orcid": "0000-0001-6092-0667"}], "keywords": ["India", "hydrology", "river gauges", "catchment boundaries", "river network", "precipitation", "streamflow"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7563599"}}]}}, "title": "Geospatial and time series dataset for hydrologic analyses within South Asia (GHSA)", "links