ns", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13169619/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13169619/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13169619/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13169619/requests"}, "updated": "2024-08-02T12:49:19.952103+00:00", "recid": "13169619", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "410069f7-df2c-4632-81cc-824e343ecd24", "key": "3. Impact on Hydrological Alteration due to Climate Change in Seti Watershed.pdf", "size": 2024275, "checksum": "md5:1a9b575898ac9bde879a4b2b73d972e1", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13169619/files/3.%20Impact%20on%20Hydrological%20Alteration%20due%20to%20Climate%20Change%20in%20Seti%20Watershed.pdf/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "617156"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 81, "unique_downloads": 69, "views": 47, "unique_views": 47, "version_downloads": 81, "version_unique_downloads": 69, "version_unique_views": 47, "version_views": 47}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2025-09-01T07:51:19.119532+00:00", "modified": "2025-09-01T07:51:19.371338+00:00", "id": 16994620, "conceptrecid": "16994619", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16994620", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.16994619", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16994620", "metadata": {"title": "Dilution factor of perennial and non-perennial European rivers", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16994620", "publication_date": "2025-08-29", "description": "<p>This dataset is supplement to the article published in Water Research: \"Impacts of climate change on the dilution capacity of perennial and non-perennial European rivers\"<br>by Margot Sepp, Mahdi Abbasi, Petra D&ouml;ll, Anna Freixa, Rafael Marc&eacute;, and Sergi Sabater.<br>Rivers provide ecosystem services, such as water purification and drinking water supply, which depend on the river&rsquo;s capacity to dilute effluents from wastewater treatment plants (WWTPs). There are no large-scale analyses of the dilution capacity of rivers that take into account the differences between perennial and non-perennial river reaches, even though more than half of the world&rsquo;s river and stream reaches are estimated to be non-perennial. We evaluated the actual and future capacity of perennial and non-perennial river reaches in Europe to dilute WWTP effluents. Future (2071&ndash;2100) climatic conditions were compared to reference (1985&ndash;2014) conditions, considering average and extreme streamflow conditions (i.e., driest months or years). The dilution factor (DF), i.e., the ratio of streamflow to cumulated upstream WWTP discharge, was annually, on average, 4.6 times lower in non-perennial than in perennial reaches under reference conditions, and decreased up to 10.8 times lower in August. Annual DF is projected to decrease significantly in two-thirds of the reaches under the high emissions scenario (corresponding to Representative Concentration Pathway RCP8.5). Reaches in the Mediterranean and semi-arid regions of Europe have low dilution capacity and are the most vulnerable to WWTP discharges. Therefore, they are particularly sensitive to climate change-induced streamflow decreases, which will further reduce DF. In contrast, under the low emissions scenario (corresponding to RCP2.6), DF will remain largely unchanged, highlighting the importance of emissions reductions in preserving the dilution capacity of the European rivers.<br><br></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Sepp, Margot", "affiliation": "Catalan Institute for Water Research", "orcid": "0000-0003-0311-4030"}, {"name": "Abbasi, Mahdi", "affiliation": "Goethe University Frankfurt", "orcid": "0000-0002-9504-9426"}, {"name": "D\u00f6ll, Petra", "affiliation": "Goethe University Frankfurt", "orcid": "0000-0003-2238-4546"}, {"name": "Freixa, Anna", "affiliation": "Institut Catal\u00e0 de Recerca de l'Aigua (ICRA)", "orcid": "0000-0003-1149-6526"}, {"name": "Marc\u00e9, Rafael", "affiliation": "Centre d'Estudis Avan\u00e7ats de Blanes (CEAB-CSIC)", "orcid": "0000-0002-7416-4652"}, {"name": "Sabater, Sergi", "affiliation": "Institut Catal\u00e0 de Recerca de l'Aigua (ICRA)", "orcid": "0000-0003-3730-0261"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1016/j.watres.2025.124499", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "869226", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000780::869226", "funder": {"name": "European Commission", "doi": "10.13039/501100000780", "acronym": "EC"}, "title": "Securing biodiversity, functional integrity and ecosystem services in DRYing rivER networks", "acronym": "DRYvER", "program": "H2020", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/projects/869226"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "16994619"}}]}}, "title": "Dilution factor of perennial and non-perennial European rivers", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16994620", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16994620?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16994620", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16994620", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.16994620", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994619", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16994619", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16994619", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.16994619", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:16994620/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:16994620/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16994620/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/requests"}, "updated": "2025-09-01T07:51:19.371338+00:00", "recid": "16994620", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "4892f95b-4f00-42a8-8395-3fb53b0fc878", "key": "HR monthly streamflow.zip", "size": 237471871, "checksum": "md5:e25a97628eeeec5d73b8abfa75733f5d", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/files/HR%20monthly%20streamflow.zip/content"}}, {"id": "aaaea57f-f667-49ea-b097-9796888fdf02", "key": "Map layers with calculated DF.zip", "size": 27743260, "checksum": "md5:0e9aea56b613a6e730fcc4bdea5c6243", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16994620/files/Map%20layers%20with%20calculated%20DF.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1228645"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 39, "unique_downloads": 36, "views": 117, "unique_views": 100, "version_downloads": 39, "version_unique_downloads": 36, "version_unique_views": 100, "version_views": 117}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-07-17T15:07:45.619946+00:00", "modified": "2026-07-17T15:07:45.863433+00:00", "id": 21414935, "conceptrecid": "21414934", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21414935", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21414934", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21414935", "metadata": {"title": "Models and Predictions for \"Diffusion-Based Probabilistic Modeling for Hourly Streamflow Prediction and Assimilation\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21414935", "publication_date": "2026-07-17", "description": "<div>\n<p># Models and Predictions for \"Diffusion-Based Probabilistic Modeling for Hourly Streamflow Prediction and Assimilation\"<br><br>This repository contains the results of the paper **\"Diffusion-Based Probabilistic Modeling for Hourly Streamflow Prediction and Assimilation\"** (https://doi.org/10.1029/2025WR042720).<br><br>`models`:<br>- `single_forcing_model`: the checkpoint and config of the single-forcing diffusion model<br>- `multi_forcing_model`: the checkpoint and config of the multiple-forcing diffusion model<br>- `inverse_model`: the checkpoint and config of the streamflow-to-precipitation inverse diffusion model<br><br>`predictions`:<br>- `pred_single_forcing`: ensemble streamflow predictions of the single-forcing diffusion model<br>- `pred_siungle_forcing_inpainting`: ensemble streamflow predictions of the single-forcing diffusion model with inpainting for training\u2010free data assimilation<br>- `pred_multi_forcing`: ensemble streamflow predictions of the multiple-forcing diffusion model<br>- `pred_multi_forcing_inpainting`: ensemble streamflow predictions of the multiple-forcing diffusion model with inpainting for training\u2010free data assimilation<br>- `precip_inverse_generation`: ensemble precipitation predictions of the inverse diffusion model with inpainting for flexible conditional generation<br><br>`daily_sim`:<br>Daily streamflow simulations using the dhbv model (https://zenodo.org/records/17055819)<br>- `dhbv_1990-2014_ep50_daymet.nc`: dhbv streamflow simulations using daymet forcing<br>- `dhbv_1990-2014_ep50_nldas.nc`: dhbv streamflow simulations using nldas forcing<br>- `dhbv_1990-2008_ep50_multiforcing`: dhbv streamflow simulations using daymet/nldas/maurer forcing separately</p>\n</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Yang, Wencong", "affiliation": "Pennsylvania State University", "orcid": "0000-0002-2105-1320"}, {"name": "Ji, Haoyu", "affiliation": "Pennsylvania State University"}, {"name": "Lonzarich, Leo", "affiliation": "Pennsylvania State University"}, {"name": "Song, Yalan", "affiliation": "Pennsylvania State University"}, {"name": "Pan, Ming", "affiliation": "University of California San Diego"}, {"name": "Lawson, Kathryn", "affiliation": "Pennsylvania State University"}, {"name": "Shen, Chaopeng", "affiliation": "Pennsylvania State University"}], "keywords": ["Hydrology"], "version": "v1", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21414934"}}]}}, "title": "Models and Predictions for \"Diffusion-Based Probabilistic Modeling for Hourly Streamflow Prediction and Assimilation\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21414935", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21414935", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21414935?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21414935", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21414935", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21414935", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21414935/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21414934", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21414934", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21414934", "parent_doi_html